WEBVTT

00:04:29.733 --> 00:04:32.435
will certainly
strike some people as strange,

00:04:32.469 --> 00:04:33.870
if not absurd.

00:04:35.438 --> 00:04:39.543
I don't know when patriotism turned into,

00:04:39.576 --> 00:04:43.547
you know, lapel pins and flyovers

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.917
and silly arguments
about pro football players taking a knee.

00:04:48.151 --> 00:04:51.254
My love of country
is about national aspiration.

00:04:52.155 --> 00:04:55.292
America is the only nation
in human history

00:04:55.325 --> 00:04:59.763
organized not by geography
or a common culture

00:04:59.796 --> 00:05:03.400
or language or religion or even race,